Category Codes What to do Success 10008, 10009, 10010 Continue Requote 10004, 10020 Retry immediately Temporary 10012, 10021, 10024, 10028, 10029, 10031 Retry after a short delay Validation 10013–10016, 10022, 10030, 10035, 10038 Fix parameters Restrictions 10017, 10018, 10026, 10027, 10032, 10042–10046 Check trading conditions Limits 10019, 10033, 10034, 10040 Reduce volume / positions State 10023, 10025, 10036, 10039 Re-read current state <pre><code>const r = await service.placeOrder(req);
switch (r.retcode) {
  case 10009: /* done */ break;
  case 10004: case 10020: /* requote → retry now */ break;
  case 10019: console.warn('not enough money'); break;
  case 10016: console.warn('invalid stops — widen SL/TP'); break;
  case 10018: console.warn('market closed'); break;
  default:    console.warn('rejected:', r.retcode, r.retcodeDescription);
}
</code></pre>

Option Default Meaning <code>trailPips</code> <code>20</code> Distance of the trailing stop behind the bid, in pips. <code>cycles</code> <code>8</code> How many times to re-evaluate. <code>intervalMs</code> <code>700</code> Delay between cycles, ms. <pre><code>// override defaults when calling the function directly
await trailingStop(sugar, cfg, { trailPips: 30, cycles: 20, intervalMs: 1000 });
</code></pre>
